      "y": 220,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 90,
      "text": "PROS:\n• Clean feed (stories hidden by default)\n• User controls what they see\n• Stories feel like \"bonus content\"\n• Works great on mobile\n• Avatar row = social proof",
